  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_033) achieve the highest accuracy (0.713). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion unchanged. It isolates the effect of image encoder choice, a critical design decision, to determine if the ViT-L architecture improves performance further. This balances exploitation of the current best setup with exploration of a key hyperparameter."
